{
  "_comment": "OpenCode, Anomaly's open source coding agent for the terminal, as a command line program per account. One artifact per platform, the tarball of opencode-<platform>, the publisher's npm package of the program for that platform, the baseline build on amd64 and the glibc build on Linux; its source set is npm and its digest the integrity registry.npmjs.org names. The agent unpacks it without package/ into opencode/package, so the program is package/bin/opencode. The versions and their digests come from the npm feed of each platform's own package.",
  "name": "opencode",
  "title": "OpenCode",
  "description": "Anomaly's open source coding agent on the command line, for each account",
  "publisher": "Anomaly",
  "uninstall_data": {
    "is_deleted": false,
    "text": {
      "en": "Each account's settings in ~/.config/opencode stay, and so does a copy of OpenCode installed outside this module.",
      "zh-CN": "每个账户在 ~/.config/opencode 里的设置都保留，在本模块之外安装的 OpenCode 也保留。"
    }
  },
